ps5 driver: batch strips, lines and points (spike 02b)

Only GL_TRIANGLES entered the deferred multi-draw batch. Every other
primitive submitted and spin-waited alone: ~70 us per GL_TRIANGLE_STRIP
draw on FW 13.60, against 27 us batched. Fans stay synchronous.

